  sig=func newIdleTimeoutReader(r io.Reader, idle time.Duration, onIdle func()) *idleTimeoutReader
  doc=newIdleTimeoutReader arms a watchdog around r. onIdle runs (once per stall)\nif any Read blocks longer than idle without returning.
